  "summary": "Design aesthetic characterized by metal surfaces with fine, parallel lines created by brushing or grinding.",
  "description": "Features matte or satin-finish metals with directional fine lines or scratches that reduce glare while maintaining a metallic appearance, creating a sophisticated, technical look. The aesthetic emerged from industrial design and became prominent in consumer electronics, automotive design, and architecture, reflecting a preference for understated luxury and technological sophistication over flashy chrome.",
